  "description": "Recording R-132-D (decision 132), under OCIO (Painter's substance config): on the plane saved to a work file, the authored sky-patch EXR imported as a project environment; get_environment_resource, get_color_lut_resource, get_tone_mapping (RuntimeError on a colour-managed project) and the default camera; then set_environment_resource (the resource URL's version read back), set_color_lut_resource(None), set_tone_mapping(ACES) and field_of_view 45, each followed by its getter, needs_saving() (whether a display change marks the project modified) and a save; in the first session and after save/reopen.",
  "inputs": [
